# RFC-004: Technical Debt Purge

## Overview
This RFC proposes a coordinated swarm effort to burn down the accumulated technical debt, specifically targeting the 884 unresolved stubs currently identified in the codebase.

## Objective
* Track and complete the burndown of 884 stubs.
* Ensure no regressions are introduced during the purge.

